    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Destroy the cubes. Expand the field.  Upgrade++.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube-Field+:\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, endless runner that puts your reflexes to the test in a third dimensional cube centric world. Inspired by the classic browser game, this reimagined version takes things to a whole new level with modern visuals, tight controls, and incremental gameplay features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer your tetrahedron through the ever tightening field of cubes. Challenging your precision, timing, and focus. But death isn't the end, it's just another step towards mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Runner, Infinite Challenge</strong> <br>No two runs are the same. Procedurally generated cube fields and dynamic speed scaling with leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incremental Progression</strong> <br>Upgrade your vessel's firepower, abilities and material acquisition . The further you go, the more resources you earn to enhance future runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Minimalism</strong> <br>Clean retro visuals and a pulsing electronic soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incremental mode</strong><br>Earn currency in the field, upgrade your vessel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless run mode</strong><br>Relive the classic game mode with a leaderboard.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Will Crash.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Will Retry. <br>You Will Transcend Speed.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Destroy the cubes. Expand the field.  Upgrade++.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube-Field+:\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, endless runner that puts your reflexes to the test in a third dimensional cube centric world. Inspired by the classic browser game, this reimagined version takes things to a whole new level with modern visuals, tight controls, and incremental gameplay features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer your tetrahedron through the ever tightening field of cubes. Challenging your precision, timing, and focus. But death isn't the end, it's just another step towards mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Runner, Infinite Challenge</strong> <br>No two runs are the same. Procedurally generated cube fields and dynamic speed scaling with leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incremental Progression</strong> <br>Upgrade your vessel's firepower, abilities and material acquisition . The further you go, the more resources you earn to enhance future runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Minimalism</strong> <br>Clean retro visuals and a pulsing electronic soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incremental mode</strong><br>Earn currency in the field, upgrade your vessel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless run mode</strong><br>Relive the classic game mode with a leaderboard.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Will Crash.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Will Retry. <br>You Will Transcend Speed.</p>",
    "short_description": "Inspired by the classic browser game. Race through a 3D field of cubes in Cube-Field+, a fast-paced endless runner with incremental mechanics. Upgrade your vessel, unlock powerful abilities, and push further with each run in a hypnotic loop of speed, precision, and progress.",
